 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Hope does not put us to shame",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "God's love is poured into our hearts",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.11,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Through the Spirit who has been given",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For while we were still helpless",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "At just the right time Christ died",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For the ungodly in that moment",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.02,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Rarely will anyone die",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 1.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "For a righteous or good person",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.82,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But God proves his own love",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.11,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "While we were still sinners",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Christ died for us",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 1.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "How much more since we are justified",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "By his blood we will be saved",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Through him from God's wrath",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.0,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
